OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fshowers will continue this evening and
OL,7,Ftonight, more frequent over Dumfries
OL,8,Fand Galloway, fewer in the eastern
OL,9,FBorders. Windy with fresh to strong
OL,10,Fwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudier day with more
OL,13,Ffrequent showers, some on the heavy
OL,14,Fside, best of the sunnier spells
OL,15,Ftowards East Lothian. Strong westerly
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
