OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday. Cloudier
OL,7,FMonday with patchy rain. Early rain
OL,8,Fclearing on Tuesday then sunshine and
OL,9,Fshowers.
